are available to ship today!","link":"","label":"","color_tint":"#33ff3f","color_tint_opacity":6,"framed":true}}},"block_order":["a1797236-2d08-4d3c-b0ce-fc525efd380b"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"gutter_size":5,"space_above":false,"space_below":false}},"957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"KNOW THE DIFFERENCE, GET THE RIGHT FOAM FOR YOUR NEEDS"}},"template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Whether you need firmer footing, extra padding, or a softer landing, we've got the right product for your sport.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-0","template--14486398697601__957551e2-3a49-4a52-a2e1-ef8b53c82493-16781201813d70ad79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cross-Linked_PE_Foam_2_1.gif","image_width":300,"title":"1 3\/8\" Cross Link Foam Mats","text":"<p>Engineered to <strong>enhance stability <\/strong>and<strong> <\/strong>prevent your feet from digging in, this premium foam provides <strong>unparalleled firmness<\/strong> that <strong>minimizes the risk of injuries<\/strong> during gymnastics activities.<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$8.33\/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY CROSS LINK FOAM MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/tumbling-super-mats"}},"c281d67f-eb7b-4e8f-9dc1-aa71b43ec344":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dual_Foam_Cora.gif","image_width":300,"title":"DUAL FOAM CORE SYSTEM","text":"<p>A combination of Cross link and Rebond foams creates the perfect folding gym mat. <strong>Firm on the top to provide support <\/strong>and prevent your feet digging in while <strong>absorbent at bottom for added shock absorption.<\/strong><br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$9.58 \/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY COMBO GYMNASTIC MATS","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/combo-gymnastic-mats"}},"template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/03b.gif","image_width":300,"title":"POLYURETHANE FOAM","text":"<p>PU foam is a <strong>dense and durable<\/strong> foam that provides <strong>excellent shock absorption and cushioning<\/strong>, making it suitable for general workouts as well as some falling and tumbling.<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$8.12 \/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY VARSITY EXERCISE MAT","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/varsity-folding-mats"}},"template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Rebond_Foam_1.gif","image_width":300,"title":"Rebond foam","text":"<p>Rebond foam is made from recycled foam pieces bonded together. It offers <strong>superior shock absorption and durability<\/strong>, making it a popular choice for activities that require heavy tumbling and falls.<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at: <\/em><em><strong>$8.12 \/ Sq.Ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY ALL-PURPOSE TUMBLING MATS","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/all-purpose-tumbling-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-0","c281d67f-eb7b-4e8f-9dc1-aa71b43ec344","template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-1","template--14491775271041__8ce3de03-4279-43f0-b7a2-7f6ad016f3fd-1686670931b407f44f-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"5e8e0d78-fa38-4154-b407-b755a2492b32":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"b7aea0e3-be47-4bd1-adab-b876b3fb4b6a":{"type":"banner","settings":{"heading":"LOOKING FOR A MORE ECONOMICAL OPTION?","text":"","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/folding-gymnastics-mat","label":"BUY EPE FOAM FOLDING GYM MATS","color_tint":"#e8e8e1","color_tint_opacity":14,"framed":true}}},"block_order":["b7aea0e3-be47-4bd1-adab-b876b3fb4b6a"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"gutter_size":20,"space_above":false,"space_below":false}},"86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54":{"type":"logo-list","blocks":{"template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-0":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/puncture_resistant1.png","link":""}},"template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-1":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/spacesaving.png","link":""}},"template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-2":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/easymaintenance.png","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-0","template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-1","template--14491775271041__86c2232d-07a2-4f7f-bf31-c6bcddb88d54-1686670750c4cd9fc6-2"],"settings":{"title":"","logo_opacity":100,"divider":false}},"214804ca-4bc8-43c3-8c9f-a4d41ed1f40d":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cmv_blk_4_1080x_1_86403daf-9444-4b45-aeb6-9ddfd2b7391f.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Combo Gymnastic Mats","text":"<p>These mats are made of a top layer that provides stability for good footing and a bottom layer that absorbs impact from falls and throws. This makes these mats ideal for intermediate to expert level gymnastics.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Intermediate to Expert Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.87\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy combo gymnastic mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/combo-gymnastic-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"cd2e4de6-3709-4d0a-add8-f232d7bb9705":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__cd2e4de6-3709-4d0a-add8-f232d7bb9705-16781201813d70ad79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Landing Mats"}},"template--14486398697601__cd2e4de6-3709-4d0a-add8-f232d7bb9705-16781201813d70ad79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Use these landing mats for extra protection and safety during jumps and flips. Made to absorb higher levels of shock, these mats will give you confidence when perfecting landings.<\/p><p><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__cd2e4de6-3709-4d0a-add8-f232d7bb9705-16781201813d70ad79-0","template--14486398697601__cd2e4de6-3709-4d0a-add8-f232d7bb9705-16781201813d70ad79-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/competition_landing_a03ac18a-cb24-46b2-b051-143e83d9a6dc.png","image_width":400,"title":"Competition landing mats","text":"<p>These mats combine the firmness of cross-link polyethylene to support stable footing with the flexibility of polyurethane foam as a bottom layer, providing enough cushion for optimal shock absorption.<br\/><br\/>Mat Thickness: Available in 12cm & 20cm<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$25.25\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy competition landing mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/competition-landing-mats"}},"template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Throw-Mats_aa4da9dc-9b56-4b99-86a7-c0770febcfe2.jpg","image_width":400,"title":"Throw mats","text":"<p>These Throw Mats are made out of heavy-duty 18 oz, vinyl that can offer extra cushioning that is ideal for a more protective landing. These mats are great for absorbing jumps in activities such as gymnastics.<br\/><br\/>Mat thickness: 4\"<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$22.81\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy THROW mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/throw-mats"}},"template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Safetfy-Cushion_82f00d72-9178-4391-a0fc-b759b83bebf3_1.jpg","image_width":390,"title":"Safety Cushions","text":"<p>Made with a honeycomb foam and vinyl surface to offer durability and ultimate landing protection. These mats' thickness and shock absorbency are perfect for preventing injuries during gymnastics and cheerleading training.<br\/><br\/>Mat Thickness: Available from 10\" up to 30\"<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$27.97\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY SAFETY CUSHIONS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/safety-cushions"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-0","template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-1","template--14486398697601__adb39424-3fb0-49ff-b865-205b96ca00e4-1678122865fdbed3f5-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"5233ba91-5d77-4a78-b50d-aac632f08458":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Portable_and_Folding_Suede_Gymnastics_Training_Balance_Beam.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"PORTABLE BALANCE BEAM","text":"<p>Portable balance beams are the ultimate tool for gymnasts of all skill levels to practice at home or on the go. <\/p><p>Designed for stability and safety, these beams feature durable, non-slip surfaces and high-density foam cores that replicate the feel of a professional beam. <\/p><p>Whether you're perfecting your cartwheels, handstands, or jumps, these balance beams help improve coordination, strength, and confidence.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$77 at 6 ft. size<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY PORTABLE BALANCE BEAM","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/portable-and-folding-gymnastics-training-balance-beam","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"GENERAL PURPOSE FOLDING MATS FOR ALL SPORTS"}},"template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>For beginners or general use, these mats provides a safe learning and practice surface.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-0","template--14486398697601__9038058c-e618-4b52-9f6f-607440e2189d-16781201813d70ad79-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_12_27f6f1a3-323f-4977-98e6-827ab2b2bacd.png","image_width":500,"title":"All-purpose tumbling mats","text":"<p>These all purpose mats are perfect for beginners that are learning to fall and tumble. Constructed out of rebonded foam and designed to provide the most amount of cushioning and impact absorption. These are ideal for general physical activities.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Beginner Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$8.90\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy all-purpose tumbling mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/all-purpose-tumbling-mats"}},"template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_5_b18b799d-52e5-4e21-94e1-9bd61cf7300c.png","image_width":500,"title":"varsity exercise mat","text":"<p>Made out of 2” 100 ILD polyurethane Foam, these mats provide a very firm and stable surface. They are great for general exercises such as aerobics, but are not ideal ideal for impact absorption sports involving falls and throws.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill Level:<\/strong> Beginner to Amateur Athletes<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.88\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy varsity exercise mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/varsity-folding-mats"}},"template--14486398697601__d5239d09-87e6-48b1-9650-8827a28d69e2-1678122865fdbed3f5-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}},"ae2fa1ba-757c-47df-87d8-2d6d0cbcd2e8":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button"